      "label": "Management",
      "content": "<h2 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 24px;\">Officers</h2><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/John%20Hopkins\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">John Hopkins</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">May 2022</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">President and Chief Executive Officer</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Mr. Hopkins has served as our President and Chief Executive Officer and as a member of our Board since May 2022. He previously served as the President and Chief Executive Officer of NuScale LLC from December 2012 to May 2022. Prior to joining NuScale LLC, Mr. Hopkins held several senior executive positions at Fluor Corporation, including Group President of Fluor’s Government Group and President of Fluor’s Global Corporate Development and New Ventures Group.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Robert%20Hamady\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Robert Hamady</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">April 2023</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Chief Financial Officer</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Mr. Hamady has served as our Chief Financial Officer since April 2023. Prior to joining NuScale, Mr. Hamady served as the Chief Financial Officer of various private and public companies and held senior roles in investment banking and finance.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Chuck%20Goodnight\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Chuck Goodnight</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">January 2024</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Chief Operating Officer</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Mr. Goodnight has served as our Chief Operating Officer since January 2024. He previously served as Vice President of Sales and Business Development for NuScale LLC.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Alan%20Boeckmann\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Alan Boeckmann</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">2021</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Non-Executive Chairman</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Mr. Boeckmann has served as a member of our Board since May 2022. He is the former Executive Chairman and CEO of Fluor Corporation.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Alvin%20Collins%20III\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Alvin Collins III</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">May 2022</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Director</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Mr. Collins has served as a member of our Board since May 2022. He is a retired executive from Fluor Corporation.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Diana%20Walters\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Diana Walters</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">December 20, 2024</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Independent Director</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Ms. Walters has over 30 years of experience in the natural resources sector. She is currently the Chair of the Board and has held various executive roles in investment and mining companies.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/James%20Hackett\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">James Hackett</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">May 2022</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Director</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">President of Tessellation Services, LLC. Former Executive Chairman of Anadarko Petroleum Corporation.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Kent%20Kresa\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Kent Kresa</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">May 2022</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Director</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Mr. Kresa has served as a member of our Board since May 2022. He is the Chairman Emeritus of Northrop Grumman Corporation.</p></div><h2 style=\"margin-top: 40px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">Directors</h2><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/John%20Hopkins\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">John Hopkins</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">May 2022</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Director</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Mr. Hopkins has served as our President and Chief Executive Officer and as a member of our Board since May 2022. He previously served as the President and Chief Executive Officer of NuScale LLC from December 2012 to May 2022.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Alan%20Boeckmann\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Alan Boeckmann</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">May 2022</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Director</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Mr. Boeckmann has served as a member of our Board since May 2022. He is the former Executive Chairman and CEO of Fluor Corporation.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Alvin%20Collins%20III\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Alvin Collins III</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">May 2022</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Director</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Mr. Collins has served as a member of our Board since May 2022. He is a retired executive from Fluor Corporation.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/James%20Hackett\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">James Hackett</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">May 2022</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Director</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Mr. Hackett has served as a member of our Board since May 2022. He is the former Executive Chairman of Anadarko Petroleum Corporation.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Kent%20Kresa\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Kent Kresa</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">May 2022</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Director</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Mr. Kresa has served as a member of our Board since May 2022. He is the Chairman Emeritus of Northrop Grumman Corporation.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 32px; padding: 20px; background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #eee;\"><h3 style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 1.25rem;\"><a href=\"/manager/Diana%20Walters\" style=\"color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px dashed #0066cc;\">Diana Walters</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-weight: normal; font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 8px;\">December 20, 2024</span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #0066cc; font-weight: 600;\">Independent Director</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; color: #333;\">Ms. Walters has over 30 years of experience in the natural resources sector. She is currently the Chair of the Board and has held various executive roles in investment and mining companies.</p></div><h2 style=\"margin-top: 40px; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sources</h2><ul style=\"padding-left: 20px; line-height: 1.6;\"><li style=\"margin-bottom: 8px; color: #333;\"><a href=\"https://www.sec.gov/ix?doc=/Archives/edgar/data/1822966/000182296624000085/smr-20240411.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"color: #0066cc; text-decoration: none;\">NuScale Power Corporation DEF 14A Proxy Statement</a><span style=\"color: #666; font-size: 0.9rem; margin-left: 8px;\">(As of: 2024-04-11)</span></li></ul>"
